stro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/lindy-ai.I1E4qEBb_Z18lLOE.svg" alt="Lindy.ai logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="98" height="28" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Lindy.ai </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Get things done 10x cheaper, 10x faster with your custom AI — no coding required. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Oct 1, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/each-ai" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/each-ai.BUoEJfO3_JbzU4.svg" alt="Each AI logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="308" height="308" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Each AI </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Turn your AI models into secure, fast, and infinitely scalable inference endpoints. Build your AI Hairstyle Changer, AI Headshot Generator flows in seconds. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Oct 1, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/relay-app" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/relay-app.DwnheF_g_13VqX6.webp" alt="Relay.app logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="424" height="96" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Relay.app </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> An automation platform you’ll love. Relay.app offers deep integrations, AI-powered automations, and human-in-the-loop control. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Sep 12, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/langflow" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/langflow.CrM-eXiV_2wWuP0.webp" alt="Langflow logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="421" height="128" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Langflow </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> LangFlow is a GUI for LangChain, designed with react-flow to provide an effortless way to experiment and prototype flows with drag-and-drop components and a chat box. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>  </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Sep 12, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/respell" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/respell.B-HpGQYz_ZnNIOm.svg" alt="Respell logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="106" height="26" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Respell </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Respell combines no-code workflows, an agent-driven chat experience, and suggestions so you can make magic with AI. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>  </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Sep 12, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/latenode" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/latenode.DZWmpbNk_Z1KpBLu.svg" alt="Latenode logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="99" height="63" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Latenode </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Streamline your business processes with Latenode, a powerful no-code integration and workflow automation platform. 🚀 Connect your favorite apps, automate tasks, and enhance productivity without writing a single line of code. 🌟 Experience seamless efficiency by trying Latenode today! </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Sep 12, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/lutra-ai" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/lutra-ai.BdvyXKRj_2fYx2j.svg" alt="Lutra AI logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="380" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Lutra AI </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Lutra AI offers a versatile AI-driven platform that enables users to automate complex processes using natural language without requiring programming experience. The tool is pre-integrated with many popular applications, providing quick deployment and ease of use. With a focus on security and reliability, Lutra AI supports a wide range of uses from data extraction to custom workflow automation, all while maintaining high safety standards as a SOC2 certified platform. Pricing plans cater to different needs, from free access to enterprise-level solutions with custom integrations and support. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 21, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/mindstudio" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/mindstudio.Cr2zCH5j_VLr1C.svg" alt="MindStudio logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="251" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> MindStudio </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> MindStudio is an AI tool designed to facilitate custom AI application development and automation without requiring code. It offers extensive integrations and customization options, making it suitable for both individual developers and teams. The tool supports a variety of AI models from leading providers and is optimized for productivity and efficiency improvements. MindStudio also supports team collaboration and offers comprehensive training resources and support to users. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 19, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/aicado-ai" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/aicado-ai.CrPNA96A_Sj25o.svg" alt="Aicado.ai logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="196" height="266" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Aicado.ai </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Add AI to your website with our customizable models. Our AI Implementation Hub helps businesses use AI without any technical skills needed. Get started today! </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 19, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/keboola" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/keboola.Ce5YhIvL_9X9oj.svg" alt="Keboola logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="130" height="33" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Keboola </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Keboola: All-in-one data platform, 700+ integrations, AI tools. Empower your teams with self-serviced data reports. Start your free project today. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 8, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/cliptalk" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/cliptalk.CpO7tVqQ_ZL2idc.webp" alt="Cliptalk logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="404" height="119" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Cliptalk </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Cliptalk helps creators create viral short-form videos without any video editing skills. Cliptalk uses AI to turn text scripts into videos in seconds and automatically publishes videos to other platforms such as Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, TikTok videos, and more. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>  </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 5, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/flowmap" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/flowmap.sF-o2CrZ_1N4Gjy.svg" alt="Flowmap logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="277" height="50" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Flowmap </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> A workflow platform for the future. Document, execute, and automate all from one streamlined platform. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>  </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 5, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/kuverto" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/kuverto.CPwUtGuO_1oBF8K.webp" alt="Kuverto logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="1214" height="234" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Kuverto </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Kuverto is a Generative AI automation platform. Maximize the potential of large language models with Generative AI Automation. Leverage GPT-4, Gemini, and Claude to automate tasks, save time, and enhance productivity. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 5, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/levity" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="flex-grow" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <div class="w-1/2 aspect-[3/2] mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <img src="/_astro/levity.DMDwvtAz_Z1GHEq1.svg" alt="Levity logo" class="logo-filter max-h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw width="99" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </div> <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-stone-900" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Levity </h2> <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 line-clamp-3 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden mb-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Maximize efficiency in freight management with Levity’s AI automation tools. Streamline sales, orders, and tracking directly from your inbox to your TMS, freeing up time to concentrate on what matters most—your customers. </p> </div> <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <li class="border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> Free Tier </li> </ul> <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw>Added on Aug 4, 2024</p> </a> </li> <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-all duration-300 border border-stone-300 flex flex-col h-full" data-astro-cid-g5sewvjw> <a href="/tools/taskade" class="block p-6 text-stone-800 hover:text-stone-900 flex flex-