</p> <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center">FAQ</h2> <div class="space-y-4"> <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm"> <details class="group"> <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-4"> <span>What is AI Workflow Automation?</span> <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"> <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"> <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path> </svg> </span> </summary> <p class="text-neutral-600 mt-3 p-4 pt-0 group-open:animate-fadeIn"> AI Workflow Automation refers to the use of artificial intelligence technologies to streamline and optimize business processes, reducing manual work and increasing efficiency. </p> </details> </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm"> <details class="group"> <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-4"> <span>How can AI Workflow Automation benefit my business?</span> <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"> <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"> <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path> </svg> </span> </summary> <p class="text-neutral-600 mt-3 p-4 pt-0 group-open:animate-fadeIn"> AI Workflow Automation can help your business save time, reduce errors, increase productivity, and allow your team to focus on more strategic tasks rather than repetitive ones. </p> </details> </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm"> <details class="group"> <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-4"> <span>Are the tools listed here free to use?</span> <span class="transition group-open:rotate